{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object, approach it, take and check properties, do a specific task, return and move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ReturnObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    />",
